#env MBUI_WIN=390x844
# The window resized across the breakpoint: a phone's Home at 390, the wide frame at 1280 (the list in the sidebar, the
# chat pressed there beside it), then 390 again: the same chat as the phone's page, words sent from it.
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
shot 1-phone
resize 1280 800
until 新建对话
tap 端到端测试
until 发消息
wait 800
shot 2-wide
resize 390 844
gone 新建对话
until 发消息
wait 800
shot 3-phone-chat
tap 发消息
type 窗口变窄后发出 {T}
tap icon:arrow-up
until 窗口变窄后发出 {T}
gone 正在发送
shot 4-sent
